        <h3>Example 1: Mid-level software engineer</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:10px;"><em>Offer: $155K. Market rate for Senior SWE in this market: $170–185K. Counter: $178K.</em></p>
        <div style="background:rgba(10,16,24,0.7); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius:10px; padding:16px; font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:20px; line-height:1.8;">
